      "hideComponent": "false",
      "topMargin": "5",
      "jcr:created": "Thu Aug 01 2024 16:44:29 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\">Stryker’s iSuite</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Stryker’s iSuite is a fully customizable, integrated operating room (OR) ecosystem that was designed to increase safety, efficiency and caregiver satisfaction. From our market leader cameras, surgical lights, and equipment management solutions to our routers, cables, and displays, Stryker offers all necessary equipment to fully integrate an OR suite. This unique, customized environment helps ensure clinicians are equipped to provide the best possible care to their patients.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Through the power of the Connected OR operating system, the iSuite provides intuitive, control of all compatible connected devices in the OR.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Whether it’s visualizing critical anatomy with the 1788 Platform, controlling surgical lights or routing critical images to displays in the OR, the iSuite is designed on a future-ready integration platform with scalable 4K video routing.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">We’ve focused on improving safety and efficiency in the iSuite so our customers can focus on patient care.</span></p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Nov 14 2024 18:16:06 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true",
      "bottomMargin": "2"
    },
